=== TOOLS/LIST ===
- get_timetable: Retrieve scheduled classes, lecture timings, rooms, and faculty for an academic batch and day.

Args:
    batch: Academic cohort identifier (e.g. 'CS-A', 'CS-B')
    day: Day of the week (e.g. 'Monday', 'Tuesday', 'Wednesday', 'Thursday', 'Friday')
  Input Schema: {'properties': {'batch': {'title': 'Batch', 'type': 'string'}, 'day': {'title': 'Day', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['batch', 'day'], 'type': 'object', 'title': 'get_timetableArguments'}
- get_fee_status: Retrieve financial payment record, tuition fees, paid amount, and pending balance for a fictional student ID.

Args:
    student_id: Fictional student identifier (e.g. '2024CS001', '2024CS002', '2024CS015')
  Input Schema: {'properties': {'student_id': {'title': 'Student Id', 'type': 'string'}}, 'required': ['student_id'], 'type': 'object', 'title': 'get_fee_statusArguments'}

